@base = http://localhost:3900/api
@tenant = acme
# A staff access token (auth.http → login)
@token = paste-tenant-access-token
@section = paste-section-id
@enrollment = paste-enrollment-id

### A section's register for a day (the roster with today's statuses)
GET {{base}}/attendance/sections/{{section}}?date=2026-10-24
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Take or correct attendance (attendance:take). Students left out are present.
### Changing a recorded status needs a reason; days past lockAfterDays need attendance:edit_locked.
PUT {{base}}/attendance/sections/{{section}}?date=2026-10-24
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2e9a-attendance-1

{
  "records": [
    { "enrollmentId": "{{enrollment}}", "status": "absent" }
  ],
  "reason": "Arrived after the register was taken"
}

### Corrections made to a day's register
GET {{base}}/attendance/sections/{{section}}/corrections?date=2026-10-24
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sections not yet submitted for a day
GET {{base}}/attendance/submission-status?date=2026-10-24
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daily school, class and section totals
GET {{base}}/attendance/reports/daily?date=2026-10-24
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly register PDF (job; poll GET /jobs/:id for the link)
POST {{base}}/attendance/reports/monthly-register
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sectionId": "{{section}}", "month": "2026-10" }

### Students under a percentage over a range
GET {{base}}/attendance/reports/defaulters?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-24&threshold=75
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student leave: apply (class teacher decides)
POST {{base}}/student-leaves
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enrollmentId": "{{enrollment}}", "fromDate": "2026-10-26", "toDate": "2026-10-27", "reason": "Fever" }

### Approve a leave (sets Leave in registers already taken)
POST {{base}}/student-leaves/paste-leave-id/approve
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
